{
  "tema": 6729,
  "slug": "alcaldesa-actriz-heroina",
  "titulo": "Feminine nouns in -esa, -triz, -ina, -isa",
  "subtitulo": "La alcaldesa, la actriz, la heroína.",
  "foto": "t07.jpg",
  "regla": "Some nouns for people form the feminine with a special ending: -esa (alcaldesa, princesa), -triz (actriz, emperatriz), -ina (heroína, reina) or -isa (poetisa, sacerdotisa). They are feminine and form the plural normally, except -triz → -trices.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Most people nouns make the feminine by changing **-o → -a** or adding **-a**. A few use a special ending instead."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Masculine",
            "Feminine",
            "Feminine plural"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "el alcalde",
              "la alcaldesa",
              "las alcaldesas"
            ],
            [
              "el príncipe",
              "la princesa",
              "las princesas"
            ],
            [
              "el duque",
              "la duquesa",
              "las duquesas"
            ],
            [
              "el actor",
              "la actriz",
              "las actrices"
            ],
            [
              "el emperador",
              "la emperatriz",
              "las emperatrices"
            ],
            [
              "el héroe",
              "la heroína",
              "las heroínas"
            ],
            [
              "el rey",
              "la reina",
              "las reinas"
            ],
            [
              "el poeta",
              "la poetisa",
              "las poetisas"
            ],
            [
              "el sacerdote",
              "la sacerdotisa",
              "las sacerdotisas"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The plural adds **-s**, except **-triz → -trices**: the **z** becomes **c** before **e**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Animals too: **el tigre → la tigresa**, **el gallo → la gallina**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Today many people also say **la poeta**. Both are correct."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
